                                                "sense_id": "301aaa37-6ea5-349a-87ad-b23d025a8732",
                                                "text": "Or doth she only seem to take\n⁠The touch of change in calm or storm;\n⁠But knows no more of transient form\nIn her deep self, than some dead lake\nThat holds the shadow of a lark\n⁠Hung in the shadow of a heaven?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
